cff-version: 1.2.0
title: dvwa-nodejs
message: >-
  Damn Vulnerable Node.js Application — a real Node.js shop
  (NodeBazaar) that is intentionally full of security bugs, for
  security training and analyzer research. Node.js port of DVWA.
authors:
  - given-names: Daniel
    family-names: Alfocea
    email: daniel@danielalfocea.com
version: 2.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/cr0hn/vulnerable-node"
keywords:
  - security
  - vulnerability
  - dvwa
  - nodejs
  - owasp
  - penetration-testing
  - security-training
abstract: >-
  An intentionally vulnerable Node.js/Express e-commerce application
  backed by real PostgreSQL and MongoDB. Ships with exploit guides,
  fix references, and a SAST benchmark, for security training and
  research on source code analyzers.